WEBVTT

00:06:58.858 --> 00:07:00.762
(Laughter)

00:07:00.762 --> 00:07:03.308
This is not that catchy catchphrase.

00:07:03.308 --> 00:07:07.210
This is innovation over the edge.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:12.176
So, people like to call Africa a mobile-first continent,

00:07:12.176 --> 00:07:14.850
but actually it's mobile-only,

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:18.495
so while everybody else is doing all of those things,

00:07:18.495 --> 00:07:19.835
we're solving the world's problems.

00:07:19.835 --> 00:07:22.158
So there's only one thing left to say.

00:07:22.158 --> 00:07:24.638
["You're welcome"] (Laughter)

00:07:24.638 --> 00:07:31.161
(Applause)